IncidentDef.letterText:
A rival hobgoblin, {CHALLENGER}, has stomped up to the colony. {FACTION}

It bellows that it will fight your strongest goblin, bare-fisted, until one of them drops. Your goblins think {CHAMPION} should answer.

A win earns glory and a lot of respect. Refusing will make your goblins ashamed of their chief. If you do not answer within 12 hours, the goblins will take it as a refusal.
